  "articleBody": "When you've got water where it shouldn't be, every minute counts! Delaying action on water damage is one of the biggest mistakes you can make, and it can lead to a whole host of bigger, more expensive problems down the road. For starters, lingering moisture can quickly lead to mold growth, which nobody wants in their home. It can also cause hidden structural damage, like rotting wood or weakened ceilings, that isn't immediately obvious. Overlooking these hidden issues means you're only solving part of the problem. Also, think about the contamination risk; depending on the water source, it could be carrying bacteria or other harmful substances that become a bigger health concern the longer they sit. Getting a clear explanation of what happens if the damage turns out to be more extensive than the initial estimate is also key. We're all about open communication here at HH Remodeling LLC. So, if you're dealing with water damage in your Aurora or greater Denver area home, don't put it off. Give us a call right away so we can get started on assessment and repair to mitigate further issues.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}